# BuildKit reads "<Dockerfile>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile. The build
# context is the workspace root (CI checks out several repos side by side, and
# docker-compose uses "context: .."), so a plain src/.dockerignore is never
# applied. Patterns below are relative to that context root.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/tests
**/docs
**/*.md
**/.coverage-agent.txt
